<title>USA: TABLE - Lawyers Title Q2 net decreases.</title>
<headline>TABLE - Lawyers Title Q2 net decreases.</headline>
<dateline>RICHMOND, Va. 1997-07-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Three months ended	Six months ended</p>
<p>					 June 30		    June 30</p>
<p>				     1997	1996     1997     1996</p>
<p> Revenue			 156,265  149,293  267,571  272,107</p>
<p>Provision for policy</p>
<p>   and contract claims	 8,340    7,298   15,320   13,584</p>
<p> Net Income			8,011    9,044    8,858   13,565</p>
<p> Earnings per share		.90     1.02	.99     1.53</p>
<p> Average shares outstanding  8,912    8,887    8,906    8,887</p>
<p> Total assets					  522,279  495,646</p>
<p>(In thousands except per share data)</p>
<p>NOTE:  Lawyers Title Corp said its net income fo the second quarter of 1996 included $2.3 million of capital gains, before taxes, while there were no significant capital gains in the second quarter of 1997.</p>
<p>Net income for the first six months of 1996 included $4.5 million of capital gains on a pretax basis, while there were no significant capital gains in the first six months of 1997.</p>
